 "description": "Dell OpenSSL Cryptographic Library v2.3 and v2.4 is used within various Dell EMC Networking products, including the S and Z-Series. Dell EMC Networking S and Z-Series are high performance 10/40GbE ToR and Core Fabric switching products designed for highly virtualized Data Centers. These switches are built on top of Dell’s Data Center hardened OS, Dell EMC Networking OS.",
